WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.761
MySQL va SQLite da filtrlash farqlari

00:13.761 --> 00:25.744
MySQL: LIKE registri va <=> tenglik

00:25.744 --> 00:39.229
SQLite: LIKE va ASCII vs Unicode tuzog‘i

00:39.229 --> 00:51.014
SQLite: GLOB va ESCAPE o‘ziga xosligi

00:51.014 --> 01:02.547
SQLite: IS NOT va REGEXP funksiyasi

01:02.547 --> 01:16.720
Uch tizim qiyosiy xulosasi
